ать.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"___ a supermarket near my house.","o":["There is","There are","It is"],"a":"There is","ex":"a supermarket → There is."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ six flats in our building.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There are","ex":"six flats → There are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ any bread in the kitchen.","o":["There isn't","There aren't"],"a":"There isn't","ex":"bread не считается → isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ any cafés near here?","o":["Is there","Are there"],"a":"Are there","ex":"cafés → Are there."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is there a bank in this street? — Yes, ___.","o":["there is","it is","there are"],"a":"there is","ex":"Yes, there is."},{"t":"choice","q":"The towels are ___ the bathroom.","o":["in","on","under"],"a":"in","ex":"Внутри → in."},{"t":"choice","q":"The bus stop is ___ the pharmacy.","o":["next to","next","near to"],"a":"next to","ex":"next to."},{"t":"choice","q":"My house is ___ the school and the park.","o":["between","behind","in front"],"a":"between","ex":"Между двумя → between."},{"t":"choice","q":"«холодильник» — ___","o":["fridge","cooker","mirror"],"a":"fridge","ex":"fridge — холодильник."},{"t":"choice","q":"«почта» — ___","o":["post office","station","supermarket"],"a":"post office","ex":"post office — почта."}]},{"title":"Часть B · напишите","items":[{"t":"input","q":"There is a lamp in my room.","a":["There isn't a lamp in my room.","There is not a lamp in my room."],"ex":"is → isn't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"There are some shops near here.","a":["Are there any shops near here?"],"ex":"В вопросе some → any.","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"(there / two chairs / in / the kitchen)","a":["There are two chairs in the kitchen."],"ex":"two chairs → There are.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"«В моей комнате есть балкон.»","a":["There is a balcony in my room.","There's a balcony in my room."],"ex":"There is + a balcony.","p":"Пе