o not have any sugar."],"ex":"some → any в отрицании.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"Вы поели в кафе.","a":["Can I have the bill, please?"],"ex":"Can I have the bill.","p":"Попросите счёт: «Можно счёт, пожалуйста?»"},{"t":"input","q":"«Сколько стоит эта футболка?»","a":["How much is this T-shirt?","How much does this T-shirt cost?"],"ex":"How much is…?","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку и соберите","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"How much apples do we need?","w":1,"c":"many","ex":"apples считаются → many."},{"t":"fix","q":"I don't have some money.","w":3,"c":"any","ex":"В отрицании → any."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Мне, пожалуйста, бутерброд.»","o":["I'd like a sandwich, please.","I'd like to a sandwich, please.","I like a sandwich, please."],"a":"I'd like a sandwich, please.","ex":"to нужно только перед глаголом."},{"t":"order","w":["i'd","coffee","of","a","like","cup"],"a":["I'd like a cup of coffee."],"ex":"I'd like + a cup of coffee."}]}]},{"id":"big2","nav":"Итоговая 2","eyebrow":"Итоговая контрольная · уроки 7–12","title":"Большая работа по второй половине курса","theory":"<p>Задания по урокам <b>7–12</b> вперемешку: прошлое, «сейчас», there is, can, местоимения с артиклями и еда.</p>\n<p>Совет: сначала определите время. Есть yesterday или last — прошлое. Есть now или Look! — Present Continuous. Есть usually или every day — Present Simple.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"Yesterday I ___ my grandmother.","o":["visit","visited","am visiting"],"a":"visited","ex":"Yesterday → Past Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"Be quiet! The baby ___.","o":["sleeps","is sleeping"],"a":"is sleeping","ex":"Сейчас → is sleeping."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ to the cinema every Friday.","o":["go","are going","went"],"a":"go","ex":"every Friday → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ there any milk in the fridge?","o":["Is","Are","Does"],"a":"Is","ex":"milk → Is there."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ swim, but I can't ski.","o":["can","can to","am can"],"a":"can","ex":"can + swim."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where ___ you last night?","o":["was","were","did"],"a":"were","ex":"you → were."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where ___ you go last night?","o":["was","were","did"],"a":"did","ex":"go — действие → did."},{"t":"choice","q":"I know Anna, but I don't know ___ brother.","o":["she","her","hers"],"a":"her","ex":"her + brother — чей."},{"t":"choice","q":"Call ___ tomorrow, please.","o":["I","me","my"],"a":"me","ex":"После глагола → me."},{"t":"choice","q":"There are a lot of ___ in the street.","o":["people","peoples","persons"],"a":"people","ex":"people."},{"t":"choice","q":"Can I have ___ water, please?","o":["a","some","many"],"a":"some","ex":"water → some."},{"t":"choice","q":"My brother is ___ engineer.","o":["a","an","—"],"a":"an","ex":"engineer → an."}]},{"title":"Часть B · напишите","items":[{"t":"input","q":"«Вчера мы ходили в кино.»","a":["We went to the cinema yesterday.","Yesterday we went to the cinema."],"ex":"go → went.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Сейчас я готовлю ужин.»","a":["I'm cooking dinner now.","I am cooking dinner now."],"ex":"Сейчас → am cooking.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«В моей комнате есть два окна.»","a":["There are two windows in my room."],"ex":"two windows → There are.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Я не умею водить машину.»","a":["I can't drive.","I cannot drive.","I can't drive a car.","I cannot drive a car."],"ex":"can't + drive.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«У нас нет хлеба.»","a":["We don't have any bread.","We do not have any bread.","We haven't got any bread."],"ex":"don't have any bread.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"I didn't went to work yesterday.","w":2,"c":"go","ex":"После didn't — go."},{"t":"fix","q":"Do you working now?","w":0,"c":"Are","ex":"Сейчас → Are you working?"},{"t":"fix","q":"There is two cafés in my street.","w":1,"c":"are","ex":"two cafés → are."},{"t":"fix","q":"She can speaks English.","w":2,"c":"speak","ex":"После can — speak."},{"t":"fix","q":"I saw they at the party.","w":2,"c":"them","ex":"После глагола → them."},{"t":"fix","q":"How much eggs do we need?","w":1,"c":"many","ex":"eggs считаются → many."}]}]},{"id":"big","nav":"Итоговая","eyebrow":"Итоговая контрольная · весь курс","title":"Большая итоговая работа","theory":"<p>Задания по <b>всем урокам</b> вперемешку. Это самая сложная проверка: нужно каждый раз самому понять, какая тема перед вами.</p>\n<p>Совет: перед ответом спросите себя: <b>есть ли в предложении глагол-действие?</b> Если нет — am / is / are. Если есть — do / does, -s или don't / doesn't.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"My flat ___ very big, but it's comfortable.","o":["isn't","doesn't","hasn't"],"a":"isn't","ex":"big — какой → isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"My flat ___ a balcony.","o":["isn't got","hasn't got","doesn't got"],"a":"hasn't got","ex":"have got: flat = it → hasn't got."},{"t":"choice","q":"My sister ___ in a café at the weekend.","o":["work","works","is work"],"a":"works","ex":"sister = she → works."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your children like school?","o":["Are","Do","Does"],"a":"Do","ex":"like — действие, children = they → Do."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your children at school now?","o":["Are","Do","Does"],"a":"Are","ex":"at school — где → Are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ are these? — They're Jack's.","o":["Whose","Who's","Who"],"a":"Whose","ex":"Чьи → Whose."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is this your umbrella? — No, it isn't ___.","o":["my","mine","me"],"a":"mine","ex":"Без предмета → mine."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ a car, so we usually go by bus.","o":["don't have","haven't","aren't have"],"a":"don't have","ex":"don't have (или haven't got)."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ to work by bike every day.","o":["go","am go","goes"],"a":"go","ex":"I → go."},{"t":"choice","q":"He ___ TV in the morning.","o":["never watches","doesn't never watch","never watch"],"a":"never watches","ex":"never без doesn't, he → watches."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where … he from? — He's from Italy. He's … .","o":["is / Italian","does / Italian","is / Italy"],"a":"is / Italian","ex":"from → is; национальность → Italian."},{"t":"choice","q":"It ___ yesterday. Today it's sunny.","o":["rains","was rainy","is rainy"],"a":"was rainy","ex":"yesterday → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"I'm … in football, but my husband finds it … .","o":["interested / boring","interesting / bored","interested / bored"],"a":"interested / boring","ex":"Я — interested, футбол — boring."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Мне холодно.»","o":["I'm cold.","It is cold for me.","I have cold."],"a":"I'm cold.","ex":"Состояние — через to be."},{"t":"choice","q":"We meet … Saturday mornings … 10 o'clock.","o":["on / at","in / at","at / on"],"a":"on / at","ex":"on + день, at + время."},{"t":"choice","q":"Does Harry have any brothers? — No, he ___.","o":["hasn't","doesn't","isn't"],"a":"doesn't","ex":"Вопрос с Does → No, he doesn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"Has Harry got any brothers? — No, he ___.","o":["hasn't","doesn't","isn't"],"a":"hasn't","ex":"Вопрос с Has… got → No, he hasn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"… keys are on the table. Are they …?","o":["This / your","These / yours","These / your"],"a":"These / yours","ex":"keys → These; без предмета → yours."}]},{"title":"Часть B · переведите на английский","items":[{"t":"input","q":"«Мой брат не пьёт кофе.»","a":["My brother doesn't drink coffee.","My brother does not drink coffee."],"ex":"brother = he → doesn't drink.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Где работает твоя мама?»","a":["Where does your mum work?","Where does your mother work?","Where does your mom work?"],"ex":"Where + does + your mum + work?","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«У неё есть собака.»","a":["She has got a dog.","She's got a dog.","She has a dog."],"ex":"has got / has.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Это не мой телефон.»","a":["This isn't my phone.","This is not my phone.","It isn't my phone.","It is not my phone.","It's not my phone."],"ex":"is not + my phone.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Ты обычно встаёшь рано?»","a":["Do you usually get up early?"],"ex":"Do + you + usually + get up + early?","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Мы из России.»","a":["We are from Russia.","We're from Russia."],"ex":"We are from Russia.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"She have got three children.","w":1,"c":"has","ex":"she → has got."},{"t":"fix","q":"Does your husband likes cooking?","w":3,"c":"like","ex":"После Does — like."},{"t":"fix","q":"Whose is this book? It's Annas.","w":5,"c":"Anna's","ex":"Принадлежность → Anna's."},{"t":"fix","q":"They doesn't live here.","w":1,"c":"don't","ex":"they → don't."},{"t":"fix","q":"Are you work on Mondays?","w":0,"c":"Do","ex":"work — действие → Do you work…?"},{"t":"fix","q":"I'm usually go to bed at midnight.","w":0,"c":"I","ex":"go — действие, am лишний: I usually go to bed…"}]},{"title":"Часть D · соберите предложение","items":[{"t":"order","w":["does","time","finish","your","what","sister","work"],"a":["What time does your sister finish work?"],"ex":"What time + does + your sister + finish work?"},{"t":"order","w":["these","aren't","gloves","mine"],"a":["These gloves aren't mine."],"ex":"These gloves + aren't + mine."},{"t":"order","w":["got","house","country","my","parents","the","in","a","have"],"a":["My parents have got a house in the country."],"ex":"My parents + have got + a house + in the country."},{"t":"order","w":["I","at","the","hardly","ever","watch","TV","weekend"],"a":["I hardly ever watch TV at the weekend."],"ex":"I + hardly ever + watch TV + at the weekend."}]}]}]}$lesson$::jsonb)
on conflict (slug) do update set title = excluded.title, subtitle = excluded.subtitle, position = excluded.position, content = excluded.content, updated_at = now();

-- Lesson 7: Прошедшее время: Past Simple (6 sections, 87 items)
insert into public.lessons (slug, title, subtitle, position, content)
values ('past-simple', 'Прошедшее время: Past Simple', 'was / were, окончание -ed, неправильные глаголы, didn''t и did, вопросы о прошлом', 7, $lesson${"sections":[{"id":"was","nav":"was · were","eyebrow":"Тема 1 · прошлое to be","title":"was и were — «был», «была», «были»","theory":"<p>В уроке 1 вы уже видели <b>was</b> и <b>were</b>. Это прошедшее время глагола to be: там, где сейчас am / is / are, в прошлом стоит was или were.</p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Кто</th><th>Сейчас</th><th>В прошлом</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>I</td><td>am</td><td><mark>was</mark></td><td>I was at home.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>he / she / it</td><td>is</td><td><mark>was</mark></td><td>The film was boring.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>we / you / they</td><td>are</td><td><mark>were</mark></td><td>They were at school.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>Отрицание и вопрос</h3>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">wasn't · weren't</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span></div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">Was · Were</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><mark>Were</mark> you at work?</td><td>Yes, I was.</td><td>No, I wasn't.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Was</mark> she happy?</td><td>Yes, she was.</td><td>No, she wasn't.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>Слова-подсказки про прошлое</h3>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Слово</th><th>Значение</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>yesterday</td><td>вчера</td><td>I was ill yesterday.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>last night / week / year</td><td>вчера вечером / на прошлой неделе / в прошлом году</td><td>We were in Sochi last year.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>two days ago</td><td>два дня назад</td><td>She was here two days ago.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>in 2020</td><td>в 2020 году</td><td>They were students in 2020.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Вчера было холодно.</span><span class=\"en\">It <mark>was</mark> cold yesterday.</span><span class=\"why\">погода — It was</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Билеты были дорогие.</span><span class=\"en\">The tickets <mark>were</mark> expensive.</span><span class=\"why\">tickets = they → were</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Меня не было дома в субботу.</span><span class=\"en\">I <mark>wasn't</mark> at home on Saturday.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>Один — was, несколько — were: <span class=\"no\">They was at home.</span> <span class=\"yes\">They were at home. ✔</span></span><span>В прошлом to be не нужен рядом с was: <span class=\"no\">I was be tired.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I was tired. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 1, тема 1: am / is / are · Урок 1, тема 10: первые примеры с was / were</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"was или were?","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ at the cinema yesterday.","o":["was","were"],"a":"was","ex":"I → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"My parents ___ very tired last night.","o":["was","were"],"a":"were","ex":"parents = they → were."},{"t":"choice","q":"The weather ___ terrible on Sunday.","o":["was","were"],"a":"was","ex":"weather = it → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"You ___ right!","o":["was","were"],"a":"were","ex":"you → were."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ at the same school in 2019.","o":["was","were"],"a":"were","ex":"we → were."},{"t":"choice","q":"The shops ___ closed.","o":["was","were"],"a":"were","ex":"shops = they → were."}]},{"title":"Отрицание и вопрос","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ at work yesterday. She was ill.","o":["wasn't","weren't","didn't"],"a":"wasn't","ex":"she → wasn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ you at the party?","o":["Was","Were","Did"],"a":"Were","ex":"you → Were."},{"t":"choice","q":"Was the hotel nice? — No, it ___.","o":["wasn't","weren't","didn't"],"a":"wasn't","ex":"hotel = it → No, it wasn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"Were they at home? — Yes, they ___.","o":["were","was","did"],"a":"were","ex":"Yes, they were."}]},{"title":"Поставьте в прошедшее время","items":[{"t":"input","q":"I am at work.","a":["I was at work."],"ex":"am → was.","p":"Напишите про вчера"},{"t":"input","q":"They are in London.","a":["They were in London."],"ex":"are → were.","p":"Напишите про вчера"},{"t":"input","q":"The film isn't interesting.","a":["The film wasn't interesting.","The film was not interesting."],"ex":"isn't → wasn't.","p":"Напишите про вчера"},{"t":"input","q":"Are you at school?","a":["Were you at school?"],"ex":"Are → Were.","p":"Напишите про вчера"}]},{"title":"Нажмите на неправильное слово","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"My friends was at the concert.","w":2,"c":"were","ex":"friends = they → were."},{"t":"fix","q":"It were very cold yesterday.","w":1,"c":"was","ex":"It → was."},{"t":"fix","q":"Where was you last night?","w":1,"c":"were","ex":"you → were: Where were you…?"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Понедельник. Коллеги о субботе","lines":[["Anna","Where were you on Saturday?","Где ты был в субботу?"],["Tom","I was at the cinema.","В кино."],["Anna","Was the film good?","Фильм был хороший?"],["Tom","Yes, it was great! Where were you?","Да, отличный! А ты где была?"],["Anna","I was at home. The weather was terrible.","Дома. Погода была ужасная."],["Tom","You were right. It was very cold.","Ты права. Было очень холодно."]]}},{"id":"ed","nav":"-ed","eyebrow":"Тема 2 · правильные глаголы","title":"worked, lived, studied — окончание -ed","theory":"<p>У обычных глаголов прошедшее время образуется окончанием <b>-ed</b>. Форма одна для всех: и для I, и для he, и для they.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">глагол + ed</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span></div>\n<div class=\"compare\"><div><span class=\"en\">I work every day.</span><span class=\"ru\">Я работаю каждый день.</span><span class=\"small\">Present Simple, урок 4</span></div><div><span class=\"en\">I worked yesterday.</span><span class=\"ru\">Я работал вчера.</span><span class=\"small\">Past Simple</span></div></div>\n<h3>Как добавлять -ed</h3>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Глагол кончается на…</th><th>Что делаем</th><th>Примеры</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>обычный случай</td><td>+ <mark>ed</mark></td><td>work → worked · watch → watched · play → played</td></tr>\n<tr><td>-e</td><td>+ <mark>d</mark></td><td>live → lived · like → liked · dance → danced</td></tr>\n<tr><td>согласная + y</td><td>y → <mark>ied</mark></td><td>study → studied · carry → carried · try → tried</td></tr>\n<tr><td>короткий глагол на гласная + согласная</td><td>буква удваивается</td><td>stop → sto<mark>pp</mark>ed · plan → pla<mark>nn</mark>ed</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Вчера мы смотрели фильм.</span><span class=\"en\">We <mark>watched</mark> a film yesterday.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Она жила в Берлине два года.</span><span class=\"en\">She <mark>lived</mark> in Berlin for two years.</span><span class=\"why\">форма та же, что у I</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я учил английский в школе.</span><span class=\"en\">I <mark>studied</mark> English at school.</span><span class=\"why\">y → ied</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Как читается -ed</h3>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Звук</th><th>Когда</th><th>Примеры</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>/t/ — «т»</td><td>после глухих: p, k, f, s, sh, ch</td><td>worked · watched · stopped</td></tr>\n<tr><td>/d/ — «д»</td><td>после звонких и гласных</td><td>lived · played · listened</td></tr>\n<tr><td>/ɪd/ — «ид», лишний слог</td><td>после t и d</td><td>wanted · started · needed</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>Форма одна для всех: <span class=\"no\">She workeds.</span> <span class=\"no\">He did worked.</span> <span class=\"yes\">She worked. ✔</span></span><span>Не путайте с Present Simple: <span class=\"no\">Yesterday I work late.</span> <span class=\"yes\">Yesterday I worked late. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 4: I work · Урок 5: правила -s / -es похожи на правила -ed</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Напишите прошедшее время","items":[{"t":"input","q":"work →","a":["worked"],"ex":"+ ed.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Обычный случай."},{"t":"input","q":"live →","a":["lived"],"ex":"Кончается на -e → + d.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Уже есть e."},{"t":"input","q":"study →","a":["studied"],"ex":"согласная + y → ied.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"y меняется."},{"t":"input","q":"stop →","a":["stopped"],"ex":"Короткий глагол: буква удваивается.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Две p."},{"t":"input","q":"play →","a":["played"],"ex":"гласная + y → просто ed.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"a перед y — гласная."},{"t":"input","q":"watch →","a":["watched"],"ex":"+ ed.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Обычный случай."}]},{"title":"Выберите правильную форму","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"Yesterday I ___ at home all day.","o":["work","worked","working"],"a":"worked","ex":"yesterday → прошлое."},{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ in Moscow two years ago.","o":["lives","lived","living"],"a":"lived","ex":"two years ago → прошлое."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ to music last night.","o":["listen","listened","listens"],"a":"listened","ex":"last night → прошлое."},{"t":"choice","q":"They ___ football every Sunday.","o":["play","played"],"a":"play","ex":"every Sunday — привычка, настоящее."},{"t":"choice","q":"My brother ___ English at university in 2020.","o":["study","studied","studies"],"a":"studied","ex":"in 2020 → прошлое."}]},{"title":"Соберите предложение","items":[{"t":"order","w":["watched","we","yesterday","a","film"],"a":["We watched a film yesterday."],"ex":"We + watched + a film + yesterday."},{"t":"order","w":["she","at","school","English","studied"],"a":["She studied English at school."],"ex":"She + studied + English + at school."},{"t":"order","w":["stopped","near","shop","the","they"],"a":["They stopped near the shop."],"ex":"They + stopped + near the shop."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Вечер. Мама звонит Кейт","lines":[["Mum","Hi! I called you at five.","Привет! Я звонила тебе в пять."],["Kate","Sorry, Mum. I worked at home all day.","Прости, мам. Я весь день работала дома."],["Mum","And in the evening?","А вечером?"],["Kate","I cooked dinner and watched a film.","Приготовила ужин и посмотрела фильм."],["Mum","Your dad cooked dinner too. He cooked fish. It was terrible!","Папа тоже готовил ужин. Он приготовил рыбу. Было ужасно!"],["Kate","Poor Dad!","Бедный папа!"]]}},{"id":"irr","nav":"went · had · saw","eyebrow":"Тема 3 · неправильные глаголы","title":"Неправильные глаголы: их надо запомнить","theory":"<p>Самые частые глаголы образуют прошедшее время <b>по-своему</b>, без -ed. Их около двух десятков в базовом наборе — их просто учат наизусть.</p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Сейчас</th><th>В прошлом</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>go — ходить, ездить</td><td><mark>went</mark></td><td>I went to the gym.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>have — иметь</td><td><mark>had</mark></td><td>We had breakfast at 8.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>do — делать</td><td><mark>did</mark></td><td>She did her homework.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>get — получать, добираться</td><td><mark>got</mark></td><td>He got home late.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>see — видеть</td><td><mark>saw</mark></td><td>I saw Anna yesterday.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>make — делать, готовить</td><td><mark>made</mark></td><td>They made pizza.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>take — брать</td><td><mark>took</mark></td><td>She took a taxi.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>come — приходить</td><td><mark>came</mark></td><td>My friends came at 7.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>say — говорить</td><td><mark>said</mark></td><td>He said «hello».</td></tr>\n<tr><td>eat — есть</td><td><mark>ate</mark></td><td>I ate a sandwich.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>drink — пить</td><td><mark>drank</mark></td><td>We drank tea.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>buy — покупать</td><td><mark>bought</mark></td><td>She bought a new phone.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>meet — встречать</td><td><mark>met</mark></td><td>I met my friends.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>write — писать</td><td><mark>wrote</mark></td><td>He wrote an email.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>read — читать</td><td><mark>read</mark> (читается «рэд»)</td><td>I read a book.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Вчера я ходил в спортзал.</span><span class=\"en\">I <mark>went</mark> to the gym yesterday.</span><span class=\"why\">go → went</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Мы поужинали в 9.</span><span class=\"en\">We <mark>had</mark> dinner at 9.</span><span class=\"why\">have → had</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Она купила новую сумку.</span><span class=\"en\">She <mark>bought</mark> a new bag.</span><span class=\"why\">buy → bought</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>К неправильным -ed не добавляют: <span class=\"no\">I goed home.</span> <span class=\"no\">She buyed a car.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I went home. ✔</span> <span class=\"yes\">She bought a car. ✔</span></span><span>write → wrote вы уже видели в уроке 3, на стикере с доски.</span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 3, тема 6: write — wrote · Урок 5: have → has, а в прошлом всегда had</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Напишите прошедшее время","items":[{"t":"input","q":"go →","a":["went"],"ex":"go → went.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Начинается на w."},{"t":"input","q":"have →","a":["had"],"ex":"have → had.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Три буквы."},{"t":"input","q":"see →","a":["saw"],"ex":"see → saw.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Начинается на s."},{"t":"input","q":"buy →","a":["bought"],"ex":"buy → bought.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Кончается на -ought."},{"t":"input","q":"take →","a":["took"],"ex":"take → took.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Две o."},{"t":"input","q":"eat →","a":["ate"],"ex":"eat → ate.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Три буквы."},{"t":"input","q":"come →","a":["came"],"ex":"come → came.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Меняется o на a."},{"t":"input","q":"meet →","a":["met"],"ex":"meet → met.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Одна e."}]},{"title":"Выберите правильную форму","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"Last night we ___ a great film.","o":["see","saw","seed"],"a":"saw","ex":"see → saw."},{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ to Italy last summer.","o":["goed","went","goes"],"a":"went","ex":"go → went."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ coffee this morning.","o":["drinked","drank","drink"],"a":"drank","ex":"drink → drank."},{"t":"choice","q":"He ___ his homework yesterday.","o":["did","done","doed"],"a":"did","ex":"do → did."},{"t":"choice","q":"They ___ a taxi to the airport.","o":["taked","took","take"],"a":"took","ex":"take → took."}]},{"title":"Нажмите на неправильное слово","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"I goed to the cinema on Friday.","w":1,"c":"went","ex":"go → went."},{"t":"fix","q":"She buyed a new dress.","w":1,"c":"bought","ex":"buy → bought."},{"t":"fix","q":"We eated pizza last night.","w":1,"c":"ate","ex":"eat → ate."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Подруги после отпуска","lines":[["Lisa","We went to Italy last summer!","Прошлым летом мы ездили в Италию!"],["Mia","Wow! I went to Spain.","Ух ты! А я ездила в Испанию."],["Lisa","We saw a lot of beautiful places.","Мы видели много красивых мест."],["Mia","I ate fish every day!","А я каждый день ела рыбу!"],["Lisa","I drank coffee every morning.","Я каждое утро пила кофе."],["Mia","And I bought a lot of presents.","А я купила кучу подарков."],["Lisa","For me?","Мне?"]]}},{"id":"neg","nav":"didn't · did","eyebrow":"Тема 4 · отрицание и вопрос","title":"didn't и did: глагол возвращается в начальную форму","theory":"<p>В отрицании и вопросе прошлое показывает <b>did</b>, а сам глагол становится <b>обычным</b>: без -ed и без особой формы. Это как с does в уроке 5 — «показатель времени один раз».</p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th></th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th><th>Вопрос</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Правильный глагол</td><td>I work<mark>ed</mark>.</td><td>I <mark>didn't</mark> work.</td><td><mark>Did</mark> you work?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Неправильный глагол</td><td>I <mark>went</mark>.</td><td>I <mark>didn't</mark> go.</td><td><mark>Did</mark> you go?</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">didn't</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">глагол</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span></div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">Did</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">глагол</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Did you see the film?</td><td>Yes, I did.</td><td>No, I didn't.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Did she call you?</td><td>Yes, she did.</td><td>No, she didn't.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я вчера не работал.</span><span class=\"en\">I <mark>didn't work</mark> yesterday.</span><span class=\"why\">не didn't worked</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Она не ходила в школу.</span><span class=\"en\">She <mark>didn't go</mark> to school.</span><span class=\"why\">не didn't went</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Ты купил хлеб?</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>Did</mark> you <mark>buy</mark> bread?</span><span class=\"why\">не Did you bought</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>С <b>was / were</b> did не нужен: у to be свои отрицание и вопрос — wasn't, weren't, Was…?, Were…? (тема 1).</p>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span><span class=\"no\">I didn't worked.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I didn't work. ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">Did you went home?</span> <span class=\"yes\">Did you go home? ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">Did you at home?</span> <span class=\"yes\">Were you at home? ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 4: don't и Do · Урок 5: doesn't и Does · здесь то же правило, только did</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите правильный вариант","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ to work yesterday.","o":["didn't went","didn't go","don't went"],"a":"didn't go","ex":"После didn't — начальная форма go."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ you watch the match?","o":["Did","Do","Was"],"a":"Did","ex":"watch — действие, прошлое → Did."},{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ her keys at home.","o":["didn't take","didn't took","doesn't take"],"a":"didn't take","ex":"didn't + take."},{"t":"choice","q":"Did they like the hotel? — Yes, they ___.","o":["did","were","liked"],"a":"did","ex":"Yes, they did."},{"t":"choice","q":"Did he call you? — No, he ___.","o":["didn't","wasn't","doesn't"],"a":"didn't","ex":"No, he didn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ you at home on Sunday?","o":["Did","Were","Do"],"a":"Were","ex":"at home — место, глагола-действия нет → Were."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ tired after the trip.","o":["didn't","weren't","don't"],"a":"weren't","ex":"tired — какой → weren't."}]},{"title":"Сделайте отрицание","items":[{"t":"input","q":"I watched TV last night.","a":["I didn't watch TV last night.","I did not watch TV last night."],"ex":"watched → didn't watch.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"She went to the party.","a":["She didn't go to the party.","She did not go to the party."],"ex":"went → didn't go.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"They had breakfast at home.","a":["They didn't have breakfast at home.","They did not have breakfast at home."],"ex":"had → didn't have.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"He was at school.","a":["He wasn't at school.","He was not at school."],"ex":"С to be — wasn't, без did.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"}]},{"title":"Задайте вопрос","items":[{"t":"input","q":"You bought milk.","a":["Did you buy milk?"],"ex":"Did + you + buy…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"She saw the film.","a":["Did she see the film?"],"ex":"Did + she + see…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"They were at the beach.","a":["Were they at the beach?"],"ex":"С to be: Were they…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"}]},{"title":"Нажмите на неправильное слово","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"I didn't saw him yesterday.","w":2,"c":"see","ex":"После didn't — see."},{"t":"fix","q":"Did she went to the shop?","w":2,"c":"go","ex":"После Did — go."},{"t":"fix","q":"Did you tired after work?","w":0,"c":"Were","ex":"tired — какой → Were you tired?"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Мама и сын. Домашнее задание","lines":[["Mum","Did you do your homework?","Ты сделал домашнее задание?"],["Sam","No, I didn't.","Нет."],["Mum","Why? Did you go out?","Почему? Ты гулял?"],["Sam","No, I didn't. I watched the match.","Нет. Я смотрел матч."],["Mum","Did you like it?","Понравился?"],["Sam","No, I didn't. It was boring.","Нет. Было скучно."],["Mum","Bad day!","Плохой день!"]]}},{"id":"wh","nav":"Where did you…?","eyebrow":"Тема 5 · вопросы о прошлом","title":"Where did you go? What did you do?","theory":"<p>Вопросительное слово ставим в начало, дальше — тот же порядок, что и в теме 4.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">вопр. слово</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">did</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">глагол</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Перевод</th><th>Возможный ответ</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><mark>What did</mark> you do at the weekend?</td><td>Что ты делал на выходных?</td><td>I went to my parents'.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Where did</mark> you go?</td><td>Куда ты ходил?</td><td>To the cinema.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>When did</mark> she call?</td><td>Когда она звонила?</td><td>Two hours ago.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Who did</mark> you meet?</td><td>Кого ты встретил?</td><td>My old friend.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>How was</mark> your weekend?</td><td>Как прошли выходные?</td><td>It was great!</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Where were</mark> you?</td><td>Где ты был?</td><td>At work.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>Обратите внимание: если в вопросе есть <b>глагол-действие</b> — нужен <b>did</b>. Если спрашиваем «где был», «как было» — это to be, и нужен <b>was / were</b>.</p>\n<h3>Как рассказать о выходных</h3>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В субботу я встретился с друзьями.</span><span class=\"en\">On Saturday I <mark>met</mark> my friends.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Потом мы пошли в кафе.</span><span class=\"en\">Then we <mark>went</mark> to a café.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Было здорово!</span><span class=\"en\">It <mark>was</mark> great!</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В воскресенье я ничего не делал.</span><span class=\"en\">On Sunday I <mark>didn't do</mark> anything.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span><span class=\"no\">Where you went?</span> <span class=\"yes\">Where did you go? ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">What did you did?</span> <span class=\"yes\">What did you do? ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">How did be your weekend?</span> <span class=\"yes\">How was your weekend? ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 6: Where do you live? · здесь тот же порядок, только do → did</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите правильный вопрос","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"«Куда ты ездил летом?»","o":["Where did you go in the summer?","Where you went in the summer?","Where did you went in the summer?"],"a":"Where did you go in the summer?","ex":"Where + did + you + go."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Что ты ел на завтрак?»","o":["What did you eat for breakfast?","What did you ate for breakfast?","What you eat for breakfast?"],"a":"What did you eat for breakfast?","ex":"После did — eat."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Как прошёл твой день?»","o":["How was your day?","How did your day?","How were your day?"],"a":"How was your day?","ex":"day = it → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Где вы были вчера?»","o":["Where were you yesterday?","Where did you be yesterday?","Where was you yesterday?"],"a":"Where were you yesterday?","ex":"you → were."}]},{"title":"Задайте вопрос к ответу","items":[{"t":"input","q":"I went to the park.","a":["Where did you go?"],"ex":"Where + did + you + go?","p":"Спросите: «Куда ты ходил?»"},{"t":"input","q":"She called me at 9.","a":["When did she call you?","When did she call?"],"ex":"When + did + she + call you?","p":"Спросите: «Когда она тебе звонила?»"},{"t":"input","q":"They met Anna.","a":["Who did they meet?"],"ex":"Who + did + they + meet?","p":"Спросите: «Кого они встретили?»"},{"t":"input","q":"It was very nice.","a":["How was it?"],"ex":"С to be: How was it?","p":"Спросите: «Как это было?»"}]},{"title":"Соберите вопрос","items":[{"t":"order","w":["what","did","do","the","at","weekend","you"],"a":["What did you do at the weekend?"],"ex":"What + did + you + do + at the weekend?"},{"t":"order","w":["this","dress","where","she","buy","did"],"a":["Where did she buy this dress?"],"ex":"Where + did + she + buy + this dress?"},{"t":"order","w":["was","film","how","the"],"a":["How was the film?"],"ex":"How + was + the film?"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Друзья после выходных","lines":[["Anna","What did you do at the weekend?","Что ты делал на выходных?"],["Tom","I went to the seaside.","Ездил на море."],["Anna","Who did you go with?","С кем ты ездил?"],["Tom","With my brother. We met our old friend there.","С братом. Мы встретили там нашего старого друга."],["Anna","When did you come back?","Когда вы вернулись?"],["Tom","On Sunday evening.","В воскресенье вечером."]]}},{"id":"final","nav":"Итоговый тест","eyebrow":"Итоговый тест · все темы вперемешку","title":"Проверьте себя","theory":"<p>Все темы урока вперемешку. Если ошибётесь, вернитесь к объяснению нужной темы через меню сверху.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Смешанные задания","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ at the seaside last July.","o":["was","were"],"a":"were","ex":"Тема 1: we → were."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ my grandmother on Saturday.","o":["visit","visited","visiting"],"a":"visited","ex":"Тема 2: on Saturday в прошлом → visited."},{"t":"input","q":"try →","a":["tried"],"ex":"Тема 2: согласная + y → ied.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"y меняется."},{"t":"choice","q":"He ___ a new car last month.","o":["buyed","bought","buy"],"a":"bought","ex":"Тема 3: buy → bought."},{"t":"input","q":"get →","a":["got"],"ex":"Тема 3: get → got.","p":"Напишите форму прошедшего времени","h":"Три буквы."},{"t":"choice","q":"They ___ to the party.","o":["didn't come","didn't came","weren't come"],"a":"didn't come","ex":"Тема 4: didn't + come."},{"t":"input","q":"She ate all the cake.","a":["She didn't eat all the cake.","She did not eat all the cake."],"ex":"Тема 4: ate → didn't eat.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"choice","q":"Did you sleep well? — Yes, I ___.","o":["did","was","slept"],"a":"did","ex":"Тема 4: Yes, I did."},{"t":"order","w":["you","weekend","did","go","last","where"],"a":["Where did you go last weekend?"],"ex":"Тема 5: Where + did + you + go…?"},{"t":"choice","q":"«Как прошёл отпуск?»","o":["How was your holiday?","How did your holiday?","How were your holiday?"],"a":"How was your holiday?","ex":"Тема 5: holiday = it → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ the weather good in Sochi?","o":["Did","Was","Were"],"a":"Was","ex":"Тема 1: weather = it → Was."},{"t":"input","q":"«Вчера я не работал.»","a":["I didn't work yesterday.","I did not work yesterday."],"ex":"Тема 4: didn't work.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Бабушка и внучка","lines":[["Grandma","Where were you last July?","Где вы были в июле?"],["Lily","We were at the seaside.","Мы были на море."],["Grandma","Did you like it?","Тебе понравилось?"],["Lily","Yes, I did! My brother bought a new phone there.","Да! Мой брат купил там новый телефон."],["Grandma","And why didn't you come to my party?","А почему вы не пришли ко мне на праздник?"],["Lily","Sorry, Grandma! We visited you on Saturday!","Прости, бабушка! Мы же приходили к тебе в субботу!"]]}}]}$lesson$::jsonb)
on conflict (slug) do update set title = excluded.title, subtitle = excluded.subtitle, position = excluded.position, content = excluded.content, updated_at = now();

-- Lesson 8: Прямо сейчас: Present Continuous (5 sections, 68 items)
insert into public.lessons (slug, title, subtitle, position, content)
values ('present-continuous', 'Прямо сейчас: Present Continuous', 'I''m working, окончание -ing, отрицания и вопросы, «сейчас» и «обычно»', 8, $lesson${"sections":[{"id":"form","nav":"I'm working","eyebrow":"Тема 1 · утверждение","title":"am / is / are + глагол-ing","theory":"<p>Present Continuous — про то, что происходит <b>прямо сейчас</b>, в момент разговора. В уроке 1 вы это уже видели: «Look! It's raining».</p>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">am · is · are</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">глагол + ing</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">остальное</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Кто</th><th>Форма</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>I</td><td><mark>am</mark> + ing</td><td>I'm working now.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>he / she / it</td><td><mark>is</mark> + ing</td><td>She's cooking dinner.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>we / you / they</td><td><mark>are</mark> + ing</td><td>They're watching TV.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>Как добавлять -ing</h3>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Глагол кончается на…</th><th>Что делаем</th><th>Примеры</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>обычный случай</td><td>+ <mark>ing</mark></td><td>work → working · play → playing</td></tr>\n<tr><td>-e</td><td>e уходит</td><td>make → mak<mark>ing</mark> · write → writing · come → coming</td></tr>\n<tr><td>короткий глагол на гласная + согласная</td><td>буква удваивается</td><td>run → ru<mark>nn</mark>ing · sit → sitting · get → getting</td></tr>\n<tr><td>-ie</td><td>ie → <mark>y</mark></td><td>lie → lying</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Смотри! Идёт снег.</span><span class=\"en\">Look! It<mark>'s snowing</mark>.</span><span class=\"why\">прямо сейчас</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Мы ждём автобус.</span><span class=\"en\">We<mark>'re waiting</mark> for the bus.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я сейчас готовлю ужин.</span><span class=\"en\">I<mark>'m cooking</mark> dinner at the moment.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Дети играют в саду.</span><span class=\"en\">The children <mark>are playing</mark> in the garden.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Слова-подсказки</h3>\n<p><b>now</b> — сейчас, <b>at the moment</b> — в данный момент, <b>right now</b> — прямо сейчас, <b>Look!</b> и <b>Listen!</b> — смотри, слушай.</p>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>Без am / is / are форма не работает: <span class=\"no\">I working now.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I'm working now. ✔</span></span><span>Не путайте с привычкой: <span class=\"no\">I am work every day.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I work every day. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 1, тема 10: первые примеры с -ing · Урок 1, тема 1: am / is / are</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Напишите форму с -ing","items":[{"t":"input","q":"work →","a":["working"],"ex":"+ ing.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Обычный случай."},{"t":"input","q":"make →","a":["making"],"ex":"Кончается на -e: e уходит.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Без e."},{"t":"input","q":"run →","a":["running"],"ex":"Короткий глагол: буква удваивается.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Две n."},{"t":"input","q":"study →","a":["studying"],"ex":"y остаётся: studying.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"y не меняется."},{"t":"input","q":"sit →","a":["sitting"],"ex":"Буква удваивается.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Две t."},{"t":"input","q":"write →","a":["writing"],"ex":"e уходит.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Без e."}]},{"title":"Выберите правильную форму","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ a book at the moment.","o":["am reading","reading","read"],"a":"am reading","ex":"at the moment → am + reading."},{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ to music right now.","o":["is listening","listens","listening"],"a":"is listening","ex":"right now → is + listening."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ dinner. Call later.","o":["are having","have","having"],"a":"are having","ex":"Прямо сейчас → are having."},{"t":"choice","q":"Look! The cat ___ on your laptop.","o":["sits","is sitting","sitting"],"a":"is sitting","ex":"Look! → сейчас."},{"t":"choice","q":"They ___ football in the park now.","o":["play","are playing","playing"],"a":"are playing","ex":"now → are playing."}]},{"title":"Соберите предложение","items":[{"t":"order","w":["I","dinner","cooking","now","am"],"a":["I am cooking dinner now."],"ex":"I + am + cooking + dinner + now."},{"t":"order","w":["writing","is","she","email","an"],"a":["She is writing an email."],"ex":"She + is + writing + an email."},{"t":"order","w":["are","the","sleeping","children"],"a":["The children are sleeping."],"ex":"The children + are + sleeping."}]},{"title":"Переведите на английский","items":[{"t":"input","q":"«Я сейчас читаю.»","a":["I'm reading now.","I am reading now."],"ex":"am + reading.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Она разговаривает по телефону.»","a":["She's talking on the phone.","She is talking on the phone."],"ex":"is + talking.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Мы ждём автобус.»","a":["We're waiting for the bus.","We are waiting for the bus."],"ex":"are + waiting for.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Папа звонит домой","lines":[["Dad","Hi! What are you doing?","Привет! Что вы делаете?"],["Kate","I'm reading a book. Mum is cooking.","Я читаю книгу. Мама готовит."],["Dad","And Tom?","А Том?"],["Kate","He's listening to music.","Слушает музыку."],["Dad","And the cat?","А кошка?"],["Kate","The cat is sitting on your laptop!","Кошка сидит на твоём ноутбуке!"]]}},{"id":"negq","nav":"Отрицание и вопрос","eyebrow":"Тема 2 · отрицание и вопрос","title":"I'm not working. Are you working?","theory":"<p>Здесь всё как с to be из урока 1: <b>not</b> ставится после am / is / are, а в вопросе am / is / are выходит вперёд. Глагол с -ing не меняется.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">am · is · are</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">not</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">глагол + ing</span></div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">Am · Is · Are</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">кто</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">глагол + ing</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><mark>Are</mark> you working?</td><td>Yes, I am.</td><td>No, I'm not.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Is</mark> she sleeping?</td><td>Yes, she is.</td><td>No, she isn't.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Are</mark> they waiting?</td><td>Yes, they are.</td><td>No, they aren't.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я сейчас не работаю.</span><span class=\"en\">I<mark>'m not working</mark> now.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Он не спит, он читает.</span><span class=\"en\">He <mark>isn't sleeping</mark>, he's reading.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Что ты делаешь?</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>What are</mark> you <mark>doing</mark>?</span><span class=\"why\">самый частый вопрос этой темы</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Куда ты идёшь?</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>Where are</mark> you <mark>going</mark>?</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>Не смешивайте с do: <span class=\"no\">Do you working?</span> <span class=\"yes\">Are you working? ✔</span></span><span>В коротком «да» нет -ing: <span class=\"no\">Yes, I am working.</span> — понятно, но короче и правильнее <span class=\"yes\">Yes, I am. ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">I not working.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I'm not working. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 1, тема 2 и 3: отрицание и вопрос с to be · Урок 6: Do / Does — для привычек, а не для «сейчас»</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите правильный вариант","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"___ you watching TV?","o":["Are","Do","Is"],"a":"Are","ex":"you → Are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ she working today?","o":["Is","Are","Does"],"a":"Is","ex":"she → Is."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ waiting for anybody.","o":["am not","don't","not"],"a":"am not","ex":"am + not + waiting."},{"t":"choice","q":"Are they having lunch? — Yes, they ___.","o":["are","do","have"],"a":"are","ex":"Yes, they are."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is he sleeping? — No, he ___.","o":["isn't","doesn't","not"],"a":"isn't","ex":"No, he isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"What ___ you doing?","o":["are","do","is"],"a":"are","ex":"Сейчас → What are you doing?"}]},{"title":"Сделайте отрицание и вопрос","items":[{"t":"input","q":"She is cooking dinner.","a":["She isn't cooking dinner.","She is not cooking dinner."],"ex":"is → isn't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"They are playing outside.","a":["They aren't playing outside.","They are not playing outside."],"ex":"are → aren't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"You are listening to me.","a":["Are you listening to me?"],"ex":"Are + you + listening…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"He is working today.","a":["Is he working today?"],"ex":"Is + he + working…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"}]},{"title":"Нажмите на неправильное слово","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"Do you waiting for me?","w":0,"c":"Are","ex":"Сейчас → Are you waiting…?"},{"t":"fix","q":"She don't sleeping now.","w":1,"c":"isn't","ex":"С -ing нужен isn't: She isn't sleeping now."},{"t":"fix","q":"What are you do now?","w":3,"c":"doing","ex":"Сейчас → doing."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Мама проверяет, чем занят Сэм","lines":[["Mum","Are you watching TV?","Ты смотришь телевизор?"],["Sam","No, I'm not. I'm doing my homework.","Нет. Я делаю домашнее задание."],["Mum","Really? Is your sister working?","Правда? А сестра работает?"],["Sam","No, she isn't. She's sleeping.","Нет. Она спит."],["Mum","Are you playing games?","Ты играешь в игры?"],["Sam","…Yes, I am.","…Да."]]}},{"id":"vs","nav":"сейчас или обычно","eyebrow":"Тема 3 · главное различие","title":"I work или I'm working?","theory":"<p>Самая важная тема урока. Два настоящих времени отличаются не переводом, а <b>смыслом</b>.</p>\n<div class=\"compare\"><div><span class=\"en\">I work in a bank.</span><span class=\"ru\">Я работаю в банке.</span><span class=\"small\">вообще, всегда — Present Simple, урок 4</span></div><div><span class=\"en\">I'm working at home today.</span><span class=\"ru\">Сегодня я работаю дома.</span><span class=\"small\">сейчас, временно — Present Continuous</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th></th><th>Present Simple</th><th>Present Continuous</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Когда</td><td>обычно, всегда, каждый день</td><td>прямо сейчас, сегодня, на этой неделе</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Слова</td><td>always, usually, often, every day</td><td>now, at the moment, today, Look!</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Форма</td><td>I work · he work<mark>s</mark></td><td>I<mark>'m</mark> work<mark>ing</mark> · he<mark>'s</mark> working</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Отрицание</td><td>don't / doesn't work</td><td>am not / isn't / aren't working</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Вопрос</td><td>Do / Does … work?</td><td>Am / Is / Are … working?</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Она обычно ходит пешком, но сегодня едет на автобусе.</span><span class=\"en\">She usually <mark>walks</mark>, but today she<mark>'s taking</mark> the bus.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я не пью кофе. — Но ты сейчас его пьёшь!</span><span class=\"en\">I <mark>don't drink</mark> coffee. — But you<mark>'re drinking</mark> it now!</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Что ты обычно делаешь по вечерам?</span><span class=\"en\">What <mark>do</mark> you usually <mark>do</mark> in the evenings?</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Что ты делаешь? — Готовлю ужин.</span><span class=\"en\">What <mark>are</mark> you <mark>doing</mark>? — I'm cooking dinner.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Глаголы, которые почти не бывают с -ing</h3>\n<p>Это глаголы чувств и мыслей: <b>know, like, love, want, need, understand, remember</b>. Их ставят в Present Simple даже про момент «сейчас».</p>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span><span class=\"no\">I am knowing the answer.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I know the answer. ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">I am wanting coffee.</span> <span class=\"yes\">I want coffee. ✔</span></span><span><span class=\"no\">Every day I'm going to work.</span> <span class=\"yes\">Every day I go to work. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 4 и 5: Present Simple · Урок 6: вопросы do / does — сравните с Am / Is / Are</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите правильную форму","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"I usually ___ at 7, but today I'm working late.","o":["finish","am finishing"],"a":"finish","ex":"usually → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"Be quiet! The baby ___.","o":["sleeps","is sleeping"],"a":"is sleeping","ex":"Прямо сейчас → is sleeping."},{"t":"choice","q":"My sister ___ in a hospital.","o":["works","is working"],"a":"works","ex":"Постоянная работа → works."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where's Tom? — He ___ a shower.","o":["has","is having"],"a":"is having","ex":"Сейчас → is having."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ to the sea every summer.","o":["go","are going"],"a":"go","ex":"every summer → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"Look! It ___.","o":["rains","is raining"],"a":"is raining","ex":"Look! → сейчас."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ what you mean.","o":["understand","am understanding"],"a":"understand","ex":"understand почти не бывает с -ing."},{"t":"choice","q":"She ___ a new phone.","o":["wants","is wanting"],"a":"wants","ex":"want — без -ing."}]},{"title":"Какое предложение правильное?","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"«Я каждый день хожу на работу пешком.»","o":["I walk to work every day.","I'm walking to work every day.","I am walk to work every day."],"a":"I walk to work every day.","ex":"Привычка → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Сейчас я смотрю фильм.»","o":["I'm watching a film now.","I watch a film now.","I am watch a film now."],"a":"I'm watching a film now.","ex":"Сейчас → am watching."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Он не работает сегодня.»","o":["He isn't working today.","He doesn't working today.","He don't work today."],"a":"He isn't working today.","ex":"today → isn't working."}]},{"title":"Задайте вопрос","items":[{"t":"input","q":"(you / what / do / now?)","a":["What are you doing now?"],"ex":"Сейчас → What are you doing now?","p":"Составьте вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"(you / what / do / at the weekend?)","a":["What do you do at the weekend?"],"ex":"Обычно → What do you do at the weekend?","p":"Составьте вопрос"}]},{"title":"Сейчас или обычно?","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"Hurry up! The bus ___.","o":["comes","is coming"],"a":"is coming","ex":"Прямо сейчас → is coming."},{"t":"choice","q":"My father ___ coffee every morning.","o":["drinks","is drinking"],"a":"drinks","ex":"every morning → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"Why ___ you wearing a coat? It's hot!","o":["do","are"],"a":"are","ex":"Сейчас → are you wearing."},{"t":"choice","q":"How often ___ you go to the gym?","o":["do","are"],"a":"do","ex":"How often → Present Simple."},{"t":"input","q":"«Обычно я работаю в офисе, но сегодня работаю дома.»","a":["I usually work in the office, but today I'm working at home.","I usually work in an office, but today I'm working at home."],"ex":"usually work + today I'm working.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Том звонит маме на работу","lines":[["Tom","Mum, where are you? You usually finish at five.","Мам, ты где? Ты обычно заканчиваешь в пять."],["Mum","Yes, but today I'm working late.","Да, но сегодня я работаю допоздна."],["Tom","Where's Dad?","А где папа?"],["Mum","He's having a shower.","Он в душе."],["Tom","He usually has a shower in the morning!","Он же обычно принимает душ утром!"],["Mum","And be quiet! Your sister is sleeping.","И тише! Твоя сестра спит."]]}},{"id":"photo","nav":"Описание фото","eyebrow":"Тема 4 · речь","title":"Опишите фотографию","theory":"<p>Present Continuous удобен, когда мы описываем картинку или фото: на ней люди что-то делают прямо сейчас.</p>\n<h3>Полезные фразы</h3>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Фраза</th><th>Перевод</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>In the photo I can see…</td><td>На фото я вижу…</td></tr>\n<tr><td>There is / There are…</td><td>Есть, находится…</td></tr>\n<tr><td>A man <mark>is standing</mark> on the left.</td><td>Слева стоит мужчина.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Two children <mark>are playing</mark> in the middle.</td><td>Посередине играют двое детей.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>They <mark>look</mark> happy.</td><td>Они выглядят счастливыми.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>I think they <mark>are</mark> friends.</td><td>Думаю, они друзья.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>Глаголы для описания</h3>\n<div class=\"ng-grid\"><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Положение</h4><ul><li>stand — стоять</li><li>sit — сидеть</li><li>lie — лежать</li><li>walk — идти пешком</li><li>run — бежать</li></ul></div><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Занятия</h4><ul><li>talk — разговаривать</li><li>smile — улыбаться</li><li>hold — держать</li><li>wear — быть одетым в</li><li>carry — нести</li></ul></div></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Женщина держит телефон.</span><span class=\"en\">A woman <mark>is holding</mark> a phone.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Он в синей рубашке.</span><span class=\"en\">He<mark>'s wearing</mark> a blue shirt.</span><span class=\"why\">wear — про одежду на человеке</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Они разговаривают и улыбаются.</span><span class=\"en\">They<mark>'re talking</mark> and <mark>smiling</mark>.</span><span class=\"why\">второй глагол тоже с -ing</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>«Одет в» — это wear, а не dress: <span class=\"no\">He is dressing a blue shirt.</span> <span class=\"yes\">He is wearing a blue shirt. ✔</span></span><span>look в значении «выглядит» идёт без -ing: <span class=\"yes\">They look happy. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 2: слова о вещах · Урок 9: предлоги места — они тоже нужны для описания фото</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите слово","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"A man is ___ a red jacket.","o":["wearing","dressing","having"],"a":"wearing","ex":"wear — быть одетым в."},{"t":"choice","q":"Two women are ___ on a bench.","o":["sitting","siting","sit"],"a":"sitting","ex":"sit → sitting, буква удваивается."},{"t":"choice","q":"The dog is ___ on the grass.","o":["lying","lieing","laying"],"a":"lying","ex":"lie → lying."},{"t":"choice","q":"They ___ very happy in this photo.","o":["look","are looking"],"a":"look","ex":"«выглядят» → look."},{"t":"choice","q":"A girl is ___ a big bag.","o":["carrying","carring","carries"],"a":"carrying","ex":"carry → carrying."}]},{"title":"Опишите фото","items":[{"t":"input","q":"(a man / stand / on the left)","a":["A man is standing on the left."],"ex":"A man + is + standing + on the left.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"(two children / play / in the park)","a":["Two children are playing in the park."],"ex":"children = they → are playing.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"(she / talk / on the phone)","a":["She is talking on the phone.","She's talking on the phone."],"ex":"She + is + talking.","p":"Составьте предложение"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Подруги смотрят фото","lines":[["Anna","Look at this photo. We're in the park.","Посмотри на это фото. Мы в парке."],["Kate","Who is this man? He's wearing a red jacket.","Кто этот мужчина? Он в красной куртке."],["Anna","That's my brother.","Это мой брат."],["Kate","And the two women on the bench?","А две женщины на скамейке?"],["Anna","My mum and my sister. They're talking.","Мама и сестра. Они разговаривают."],["Kate","And the dog is lying on the grass. Everybody looks happy!","А собака лежит на траве. Все выглядят счастливыми!"]]}},{"id":"final","nav":"Итоговый тест","eyebrow":"Итоговый тест · все темы вперемешку","title":"Проверьте себя","theory":"<p>Все темы урока вперемешку. Если ошибётесь, вернитесь к объяснению нужной темы через меню сверху.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Смешанные задания","items":[{"t":"input","q":"come →","a":["coming"],"ex":"Тема 1: e уходит.","p":"Напишите глагол с -ing","h":"Без e."},{"t":"choice","q":"Listen! Somebody ___.","o":["sings","is singing"],"a":"is singing","ex":"Тема 1: Listen! → сейчас."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ my homework at the moment.","o":["do","am doing"],"a":"am doing","ex":"Тема 1: at the moment → am doing."},{"t":"input","q":"They are having lunch.","a":["They aren't having lunch.","They are not having lunch."],"ex":"Тема 2: are → aren't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"choice","q":"___ he working today? — Yes, he is.","o":["Is","Does","Do"],"a":"Is","ex":"Тема 2: he → Is."},{"t":"choice","q":"My parents ___ TV every evening.","o":["watch","are watching"],"a":"watch","ex":"Тема 3: every evening → Present Simple."},{"t":"choice","q":"Sorry, I can't talk. I ___ the bus.","o":["catch","am catching"],"a":"am catching","ex":"Тема 3: сейчас → am catching."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ this song!","o":["love","am loving"],"a":"love","ex":"Тема 3: love — без -ing."},{"t":"order","w":["you","now","are","what","doing"],"a":["What are you doing now?"],"ex":"Тема 2: What + are + you + doing + now?"},{"t":"fix","q":"She is wear a red dress.","w":2,"c":"wearing","ex":"Тема 4: is + wearing."},{"t":"input","q":"«Дети играют в саду.»","a":["The children are playing in the garden.","Children are playing in the garden."],"ex":"Тема 1: are + playing.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"choice","q":"What ___ you usually do after work?","o":["do","are"],"a":"do","ex":"Тема 3: usually → Present Simple."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Поздний вечер дома","lines":[["Mum","Listen! Somebody is singing.","Слушай! Кто-то поёт."],["Dad","It's our neighbour. He's having a shower.","Это наш сосед. Он в душе."],["Mum","Are the kids sleeping?","Дети спят?"],["Dad","No, they aren't. They're doing their homework.","Нет. Они делают домашнее задание."],["Mum","At eleven?","В одиннадцать?"],["Dad","Yes. Everybody is working late today!","Да. Сегодня все работают допоздна!"]]}}]}$lesson$::jsonb)
on conflict (slug) do update set title = excluded.title, subtitle = excluded.subtitle, position = excluded.position, content = excluded.content, updated_at = now();

-- Lesson 9: there is / there are: что где находится (5 sections, 62 items)
insert into public.lessons (slug, title, subtitle, position, content)
values ('there-is', 'there is / there are: что где находится', 'there is / there are, some и any, предлоги места, дом и комнаты, город', 9, $lesson${"sections":[{"id":"form","nav":"there is · are","eyebrow":"Тема 1 · есть, находится","title":"There is a table. There are two chairs.","theory":"<p>Когда мы говорим, что <b>что-то где-то есть</b>, по-русски получается «в комнате есть стол» или просто «в комнате стол». По-английски такое предложение начинается с <b>there is</b> или <b>there are</b>.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">There is · There are</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">что</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">где</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Сколько</th><th>Форма</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>один предмет</td><td><mark>There is</mark> (There's)</td><td>There's a lamp on the table.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>несколько</td><td><mark>There are</mark></td><td>There are two windows in the room.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"compare\"><div><span class=\"en\">There is a café near my house.</span><span class=\"ru\">Рядом с домом есть кафе.</span><span class=\"small\">говорим, что кафе существует</span></div><div><span class=\"en\">The café is near my house.</span><span class=\"ru\">Кафе рядом с моим домом.</span><span class=\"small\">кафе уже известно, говорим, где оно</span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В моей комнате есть кровать и шкаф.</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>There's</mark> a bed and a wardrobe in my room.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В холодильнике есть молоко.</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>There's</mark> some milk in the fridge.</span><span class=\"why\">молоко не считается → some</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В нашем доме пять этажей.</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>There are</mark> five floors in our building.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Форма выбирается по <b>первому</b> предмету после there: There's a chair and two tables.</p>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>Это не «он / она»: <span class=\"no\">It is a café near my house.</span> <span class=\"yes\">There is a café near my house. ✔</span></span><span>Не путайте с their (их) и they're (они есть): there — «там, есть».</span><span><span class=\"no\">There are a book on the table.</span> <span class=\"yes\">There is a book on the table. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 1: to be · Урок 2: this / these — здесь «есть» звучит иначе</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"There is или There are?","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"___ a big park near my house.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There is","ex":"a park — один → There is."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ three bedrooms in our flat.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There are","ex":"three bedrooms → There are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ a lot of people in the shop.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There are","ex":"people — много → There are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ some water in the bottle.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There is","ex":"water не считается → There is."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ two cafés and a bank in my street.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There are","ex":"Сначала идут two cafés → There are."}]},{"title":"Какое предложение правильное?","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"«В комнате есть окно.»","o":["There is a window in the room.","It is a window in the room.","There are a window in the room."],"a":"There is a window in the room.","ex":"There is + a window."},{"t":"choice","q":"«В городе много магазинов.»","o":["There are a lot of shops in the city.","There is a lot of shops in the city.","In the city have a lot of shops."],"a":"There are a lot of shops in the city.","ex":"shops — несколько → There are."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Мой телефон на столе.»","o":["My phone is on the table.","There is my phone on the table."],"a":"My phone is on the table.","ex":"Телефон уже известен — это обычное предложение с to be."}]},{"title":"Соберите предложение","items":[{"t":"order","w":["on","a","table","lamp","the","is","there"],"a":["There is a lamp on the table."],"ex":"There is + a lamp + on the table."},{"t":"order","w":["kitchen","there","chairs","are","four","the","in"],"a":["There are four chairs in the kitchen."],"ex":"There are + four chairs + in the kitchen."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Анна зовёт Тома в парк","lines":[["Anna","There is a big park near my house.","Рядом с моим домом большой парк."],["Tom","Is it nice?","Красивый?"],["Anna","Yes! There's a lake and there are a lot of trees.","Да! Там есть озеро и много деревьев."],["Tom","Is there a café?","А кафе есть?"],["Anna","Yes, there is a café next to the lake.","Да, рядом с озером есть кафе."],["Tom","Let's go on Sunday!","Пойдём в воскресенье!"]]}},{"id":"negq","nav":"some · any","eyebrow":"Тема 2 · отрицание и вопрос","title":"There isn't any… Is there a…?","theory":"<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">There isn't · There aren't</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot be\">any</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">что</span></div>\n<div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"slot be\">Is there · Are there</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">что</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">где</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><mark>Is there</mark> a bank near here?</td><td>Yes, there is.</td><td>No, there isn't.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>Are there</mark> any shops?</td><td>Yes, there are.</td><td>No, there aren't.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>some и any</h3>\n<p>Вы уже видели <b>any</b> в уроке 3 с have got. Правило то же самое.</p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Где</th><th>Что ставим</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>утверждение</td><td><mark>some</mark> — немного, несколько</td><td>There are some eggs in the fridge.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>отрицание</td><td><mark>any</mark></td><td>There isn't any bread.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>вопрос</td><td><mark>any</mark></td><td>Are there any cafés near here?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>один предмет</td><td><mark>a / an</mark></td><td>Is there a pharmacy in this street?</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В комнате нет телевизора.</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>There isn't</mark> a TV in the room.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Здесь поблизости нет магазинов.</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>There aren't any</mark> shops near here.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Сколько комнат в квартире?</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>How many</mark> rooms <mark>are there</mark> in the flat?</span><span class=\"why\">порядок: are there</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span><span class=\"no\">There are not any shop.</span> <span class=\"yes\">There isn't a shop. ✔</span> <span class=\"yes\">There aren't any shops. ✔</span></span><span>В вопросе there идёт после is / are: <span class=\"no\">There is a bank near here?</span> <span class=\"yes\">Is there a bank near here? ✔</span></span><span>В коротком ответе есть there: <span class=\"no\">Yes, it is.</span> <span class=\"yes\">Yes, there is. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 3, тема 2: any в отрицаниях · Урок 6, тема 5: much и many</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите правильный вариант","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"___ any milk in the fridge?","o":["Is there","Are there","There is"],"a":"Is there","ex":"milk не считается → Is there."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ any good restaurants in your town?","o":["Is there","Are there"],"a":"Are there","ex":"restaurants → Are there."},{"t":"choice","q":"There ___ any children in the park.","o":["isn't","aren't"],"a":"aren't","ex":"children — несколько → aren't."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is there a lift in the building? — No, ___.","o":["there isn't","it isn't","there aren't"],"a":"there isn't","ex":"No, there isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"There are ___ nice cafés in this street.","o":["some","any","a"],"a":"some","ex":"Утверждение → some."},{"t":"choice","q":"There isn't ___ sugar in my tea.","o":["some","any","a"],"a":"any","ex":"Отрицание → any."}]},{"title":"Сделайте отрицание и вопрос","items":[{"t":"input","q":"There is a park near here.","a":["There isn't a park near here.","There is not a park near here."],"ex":"is → isn't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"There are some shops in this street.","a":["There aren't any shops in this street.","There are not any shops in this street."],"ex":"some → any в отрицании.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"There is a pharmacy near here.","a":["Is there a pharmacy near here?"],"ex":"Is + there + a pharmacy…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"There are some buses at night.","a":["Are there any buses at night?"],"ex":"В вопросе some → any: Are there any buses…?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"}]},{"title":"Нажмите на неправильное слово","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"There is two beds in the room.","w":1,"c":"are","ex":"two beds → are."},{"t":"fix","q":"Are there some cafés near here?","w":2,"c":"any","ex":"В вопросе → any."},{"t":"fix","q":"Is there a bank? — Yes, it is.","w":6,"c":"there","ex":"Короткий ответ: Yes, there is."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Пустой холодильник","lines":[["Tom","Is there any milk in the fridge?","В холодильнике есть молоко?"],["Mum","No, there isn't.","Нет."],["Tom","Are there any eggs?","А яйца?"],["Mum","No, there aren't.","Нет."],["Tom","Is there any bread?","А хлеб?"],["Mum","No. There isn't any food. Let's go to the shop!","Нет. Еды нет совсем. Пойдём в магазин!"]]}},{"id":"where","nav":"Предлоги места","eyebrow":"Тема 3 · где именно","title":"in, on, under, next to, between","theory":"<div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Предлог</th><th>Значение</th><th>Пример</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><mark>in</mark></td><td>в, внутри</td><td>The keys are in my bag.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>on</mark></td><td>на поверхности</td><td>The book is on the table.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>under</mark></td><td>под</td><td>The cat is under the chair.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>next to</mark></td><td>рядом с</td><td>The bank is next to the café.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>between</mark></td><td>между</td><td>The shop is between the bank and the park.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>behind</mark></td><td>за, позади</td><td>The garden is behind the house.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>in front of</mark></td><td>перед</td><td>There's a car in front of the house.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>opposite</mark></td><td>напротив</td><td>The pharmacy is opposite the school.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><mark>near</mark></td><td>недалеко от</td><td>I live near the station.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>В уроке 1 уже были <b>above</b> — над и <b>below</b> — под, а в теме 12 того же урока — <b>on the left</b> и <b>on the right</b>.</p>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Кот под столом.</span><span class=\"en\">The cat is <mark>under</mark> the table.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Между банком и аптекой есть кафе.</span><span class=\"en\">There's a café <mark>between</mark> the bank and the pharmacy.</span><span class=\"why\">between … and …</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Напротив дома есть парк.</span><span class=\"en\">There's a park <mark>opposite</mark> my house.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>next to — всегда с to: <span class=\"no\">The bank is next the café.</span> <span class=\"yes\">The bank is next to the café. ✔</span></span><span>in front of — «перед», а не «напротив»: напротив — <span class=\"yes\">opposite ✔</span></span><span>Не путайте in и on: <span class=\"yes\">in the box ✔</span> — внутри, <span class=\"yes\">on the box ✔</span> — сверху</span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 1, темы 7 и 12: above, below, on the left, on the right · Урок 4: at / on / in — но там про время</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите предлог","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"The milk is ___ the fridge.","o":["in","on","under"],"a":"in","ex":"Внутри холодильника → in."},{"t":"choice","q":"Your phone is ___ the table.","o":["in","on","between"],"a":"on","ex":"На поверхности → on."},{"t":"choice","q":"The shoes are ___ the bed.","o":["under","on","next"],"a":"under","ex":"Под кроватью → under."},{"t":"choice","q":"The café is ___ the bank.","o":["next to","next","near to"],"a":"next to","ex":"next to — рядом с."},{"t":"choice","q":"The school is ___ the park and the shop.","o":["between","next to","behind"],"a":"between","ex":"Между двумя → between."},{"t":"choice","q":"There's a bus stop ___ my house. I can see it from the window.","o":["in front of","in","under"],"a":"in front of","ex":"Перед домом → in front of."},{"t":"choice","q":"The pharmacy is ___ the supermarket, on the other side of the street.","o":["opposite","behind","in"],"a":"opposite","ex":"Напротив → opposite."}]},{"title":"Опишите комнату","items":[{"t":"input","q":"(there / a lamp / on / the table)","a":["There is a lamp on the table.","There's a lamp on the table."],"ex":"There is + a lamp + on the table.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"(the cat / under / the chair)","a":["The cat is under the chair."],"ex":"The cat + is + under the chair.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"(there / two windows / in / the kitchen)","a":["There are two windows in the kitchen."],"ex":"two windows → There are.","p":"Составьте предложение"}]},{"title":"Переведите на английский","items":[{"t":"input","q":"«Ключи в сумке.»","a":["The keys are in the bag.","The keys are in my bag."],"ex":"keys → are + in.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Кафе рядом с банком.»","a":["The café is next to the bank.","The cafe is next to the bank."],"ex":"next to.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Перед домом есть парк.»","a":["There is a park in front of the house.","There's a park in front of the house."],"ex":"There is + in front of.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Утро. Том ищет свои вещи","lines":[["Tom","Mum, where is my phone?","Мам, где мой телефон?"],["Mum","It's on the table.","На столе."],["Tom","And my shoes?","А моя обувь?"],["Mum","They're under the bed.","Под кроватью."],["Tom","And my bag?","А сумка?"],["Mum","It's between the sofa and the door.","Между диваном и дверью."],["Tom","And where is my homework?","А где моё домашнее задание?"],["Mum","Ask the dog!","Спроси у собаки!"]]}},{"id":"home","nav":"Дом и город","eyebrow":"Тема 4 · лексика","title":"Комнаты, мебель и места в городе","theory":"<div class=\"ng-grid\"><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Комнаты</h4><ul><li>flat — квартира</li><li>house — дом</li><li>room — комната</li><li>kitchen — кухня</li><li>bedroom — спальня</li><li>bathroom — ванная</li><li>living room — гостиная</li><li>hall — прихожая</li><li>balcony — балкон</li><li>garden — сад</li></ul></div><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Мебель и вещи</h4><ul><li>table — стол</li><li>chair — стул</li><li>bed — кровать</li><li>sofa — диван</li><li>wardrobe — шкаф</li><li>fridge — холодильник</li><li>cooker — плита</li><li>shower — душ</li><li>lamp — лампа</li><li>mirror — зеркало</li></ul></div></div>\n<div class=\"ng-grid\"><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Места в городе</h4><ul><li>shop — магазин</li><li>supermarket — супермаркет</li><li>pharmacy / chemist's — аптека</li><li>bank — банк</li><li>post office — почта</li><li>station — вокзал, станция</li><li>bus stop — остановка</li></ul></div><div class=\"ng\"><h4>Куда ходят</h4><ul><li>café — кафе</li><li>restaurant — ресторан</li><li>cinema — кинотеатр</li><li>museum — музей</li><li>park — парк</li><li>gym — спортзал</li><li>school — школа</li></ul></div></div>\n<h3>Как спросить дорогу и рассказать о доме</h3>\n<ul class=\"examples\">\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Тут рядом есть аптека?</span><span class=\"en\"><mark>Is there</mark> a pharmacy <mark>near here</mark>?</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Да, напротив вокзала.</span><span class=\"en\">Yes, <mark>opposite</mark> the station.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">Я живу в квартире с двумя спальнями.</span><span class=\"en\">I live in a flat <mark>with</mark> two bedrooms.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ru\">В гостиной есть большой диван.</span><span class=\"en\">There's a big sofa in the <mark>living room</mark>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pit\"><span class=\"tag\">Частая ошибка</span><span>flat — квартира (брит.), apartment — амер. Оба верны.</span><span>«живу в доме» — <span class=\"yes\">I live in a house. ✔</span>, а «дома» без предлога — <span class=\"yes\">I'm at home. ✔</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"sticky\"><span class=\"tag\">Связь с курсом</span><span>Урок 2: вещи, которые мы носим с собой · Урок 5: распорядок дня — там же go home, get home</span></div>","groups":[{"title":"Выберите слово","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"«кухня» — ___","o":["kitchen","bathroom","bedroom"],"a":"kitchen","ex":"kitchen — кухня."},{"t":"choice","q":"«спальня» — ___","o":["bedroom","living room","hall"],"a":"bedroom","ex":"bedroom — спальня."},{"t":"choice","q":"«холодильник» — ___","o":["fridge","cooker","wardrobe"],"a":"fridge","ex":"fridge — холодильник."},{"t":"choice","q":"«аптека» — ___","o":["pharmacy","post office","station"],"a":"pharmacy","ex":"pharmacy — аптека."},{"t":"choice","q":"«шкаф для одежды» — ___","o":["wardrobe","sofa","mirror"],"a":"wardrobe","ex":"wardrobe — шкаф для одежды."},{"t":"choice","q":"«остановка автобуса» — ___","o":["bus stop","station","bus station"],"a":"bus stop","ex":"bus stop — остановка."}]},{"title":"Расскажите о доме и районе","items":[{"t":"input","q":"(there / a balcony / in my flat)","a":["There is a balcony in my flat.","There's a balcony in my flat."],"ex":"There is + a balcony.","p":"Составьте предложение"},{"t":"input","q":"(is / there / a supermarket / near here?)","a":["Is there a supermarket near here?"],"ex":"Is + there + a supermarket + near here?","p":"Составьте вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"«В моей квартире три комнаты.»","a":["There are three rooms in my flat.","My flat has three rooms.","There are three rooms in my apartment."],"ex":"three rooms → There are.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Ещё слова","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"«ванная» — ___","o":["bathroom","bedroom","kitchen"],"a":"bathroom","ex":"bathroom — ванная."},{"t":"choice","q":"«вокзал» — ___","o":["station","bus stop","post office"],"a":"station","ex":"station — вокзал."},{"t":"choice","q":"«зеркало» — ___","o":["mirror","lamp","cooker"],"a":"mirror","ex":"mirror — зеркало."},{"t":"choice","q":"«сад» — ___","o":["garden","hall","balcony"],"a":"garden","ex":"garden — сад."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where do you sleep? — In the ___.","o":["bedroom","kitchen","hall"],"a":"bedroom","ex":"Спим в спальне."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Ольга показывает свою квартиру","lines":[["Olga","Welcome! There are three rooms in my flat.","Добро пожаловать! В моей квартире три комнаты."],["Anna","Is there a balcony?","Балкон есть?"],["Olga","Yes, there is. It's small.","Да. Маленький."],["Anna","Where do you sleep?","Где ты спишь?"],["Olga","In the bedroom, of course!","В спальне, конечно!"],["Anna","Is there a supermarket near here?","А рядом есть супермаркет?"],["Olga","Yes, next to my house.","Да, рядом с моим домом."]]}},{"id":"final","nav":"Итоговый тест","eyebrow":"Итоговый тест · все темы вперемешку","title":"Проверьте себя","theory":"<p>Все темы урока вперемешку. Если ошибётесь, вернитесь к объяснению нужной темы через меню сверху.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Смешанные задания","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"___ a new café in our street.","o":["There is","There are","It is"],"a":"There is","ex":"Тема 1: a café → There is."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ five people in the room.","o":["There is","There are"],"a":"There are","ex":"Тема 1: five people → There are."},{"t":"choice","q":"There ___ any milk in the fridge.","o":["isn't","aren't"],"a":"isn't","ex":"Тема 2: milk не считается → isn't."},{"t":"input","q":"There are some chairs in the hall.","a":["There aren't any chairs in the hall.","There are not any chairs in the hall."],"ex":"Тема 2: some → any в отрицании.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"choice","q":"Is there a bank near here? — Yes, ___.","o":["there is","it is","there are"],"a":"there is","ex":"Тема 2: Yes, there is."},{"t":"choice","q":"The keys are ___ my bag.","o":["in","on","under"],"a":"in","ex":"Тема 3: внутри → in."},{"t":"choice","q":"The park is ___ the school and the station.","o":["between","next","in front"],"a":"between","ex":"Тема 3: между двумя → between."},{"t":"choice","q":"«гостиная» — ___","o":["living room","bedroom","hall"],"a":"living room","ex":"Тема 4: living room."},{"t":"order","w":["a","pharmacy","is","here","there","near"],"a":["Is there a pharmacy near here?"],"ex":"Тема 2: Is + there + a pharmacy + near here?"},{"t":"fix","q":"There is two bedrooms in my flat.","w":1,"c":"are","ex":"Тема 1: two bedrooms → are."},{"t":"input","q":"«На столе есть лампа.»","a":["There is a lamp on the table.","There's a lamp on the table."],"ex":"Тема 1 и 3: There is + on the table.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"choice","q":"There's a car ___ the house. I can see it from the window.","o":["in front of","opposite","under"],"a":"in front of","ex":"Тема 3: перед домом → in front of."}]}],"listen":{"scene":"Новое кафе на улице","lines":[["Kate","There's a new café in our street!","На нашей улице открылось новое кафе!"],["Tom","Are there any free tables?","Там есть свободные столики?"],["Kate","Yes, there are two.","Да, два."],["Tom","Is there any cake?","А торт есть?"],["Kate","Yes, there is. But there isn't any coffee!","Есть. Но кофе нет!"],["Tom","A café without coffee?","Кафе без кофе?"]]}}]}$lesson$::jsonb)
